{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04589","headline":"五君咏五首 赵耿公彦昭 · 张说","name":"五君咏五首 赵耿公彦昭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"耿公山岳秀，才杰心亦妙。\n鸷鸟峻标立，哀玉扣清调。\n协赞休明啓，恩华日月照。\n何意瑶台云，风吹落江徼。\n湘流下浔阳，洒泪一投吊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04589.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04589","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}